<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.antigen.lifts ~ a lift supersedes by causal fold, never deletion

`lares nexus un_kapae <nym> [nexus=<aid>]` mints a quorum-signed lift whose causal parents name the ban heads it answers, so it supersedes exactly the raises it read; a concurrent raise and lift fold unsettled. `--out` and `--from` carry a partial between vaults. Nothing leaves the board.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ lift

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`lift` params=`nym/<nym> ~ lift a ban`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nym · nexus · out · from

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nym` params=`takes/nym seat/1 as/<nym> ~ the presenter restored`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the partial for the next vault`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/host-path ~ judge and cosign a partial another vault wrote`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the seat quorum signs; a sub-quorum refuses`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.antigen.lifts nym/<nym>]] ~ no nym, or a malformed one`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ lifted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`lifted` params=`exit/0 ~ the lift landed, or the partial written`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

